# Allowlist for scripts/ci/test-no-instance-data.sh. One entry per line: <path-glob> TAB <regex> TAB <reason>.
# The regex must match the whole flagged token (an address, a /home/<user>/ prefix or a dolt.<host> name). Write a path
# separator as [/] so the entry does not flag itself.
# Every entry needs a reason. Do not write the live domain here.
#
# Generic ranges (ADR 0001 item 7): they identify nothing specific and recreate the stack identically.
# The Dolt host name (ADR 0001 item 6) is public by design. Entries with reason "removed by ds-nhh.5.8" are
# temporary: delete each with the change that removes the data.

